        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>高考语文答题技巧汇总</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #fdf7ef;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 30px 35px 50px 35px;\n    position: relative;\n    background-color: #fdf7ef;\n    background-image:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 34px);\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n\n  /* Watermark layer */\n  .watermark-layer {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(8, 1fr);\n    z-index: 0;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .watermark-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #e0a95c;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    opacity: 0.45;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .watermark-item::before {\n    content: \"🌞\";\n    margin-right: 3px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 10px 0 12px 0;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n\n  .title-bar {\n    height: 8px;\n    background-color: #2f6fd6;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #222;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n\n  .plain-line {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .section-gap {\n    height: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .heading-blue {\n    color: #2f6fd6;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .indent1 {\n    padding-left: 1.2em;\n  }\n\n  .indent2 {\n    padding-left: 2.4em;\n  }\n\n  .item-line {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .bracket-note {\n    color: #222;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Watermark grid -->\n  <div class=\"watermark-layer\">\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark-item\">升本哆咪君</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">高考语文答题技巧汇总</h1>\n  <div class=\"title-bar\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">分类别：条理清晰</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">下定义：科学准确</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">引用：更具体</p>\n\n    <div class=\"section-gap\"></div>\n\n    <p class=\"heading-blue\">议论文阅读</p>\n    <p class=\"heading-blue indent1\">论证方法</p>\n    <p class=\"item-line\">1举例论证：具体有力</p>\n    <p class=\"item-line\">2·道理论证：具有权威性</p>\n    <p class=\"item-line\">3·比喻论证：生动形象</p>\n    <p class=\"item-line\">4·对比论证：全面深刻</p>\n\n    <div class=\"section-gap\"></div>\n\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">句子作用是：</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">(1) 总领全文【在开头】 (2) 承上启下 (3) 引出下文 (4) 提纲挈领</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">【在最后】</p>\n\n    <div class=\"section-gap\"></div>\n\n    <p class=\"heading-blue\">小说</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line indent1\">小说三要素</p>\n    <p class=\"heading-blue indent1\">(一) 人物形象</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line indent2\">1、人物描写角度</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line indent2\">(1)、正面描写（直接）：外貌、语言、动作、心理、细节</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line indent2\">(2)、侧面描写（间接）：借助他人对比、衬托;借助物象、环境衬托</p>\n    <p class=\"heading-blue indent1\">2、人物描写作用</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">(1)、外貌动作：更好的展现人物的内心及性格特征；</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">(2)、语言：刻画人物性格，反应人物心理，促进故事情节发展。</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">描摹人物语态，使形象刻画栩栩如生，跃然纸上。</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">(3)、心理：直接表现人物思想和内在情感（矛盾、焦虑、担心、喜悦、</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">兴奋）表现人物思想品质，推动故事情节发展。</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">(4)、细节：刻画人物形象、深化主题、推动故事情节发展、渲染时代气</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">氛,地方特色、渲染人物心情，心理活动。</p>\n    <p class=\"plain-line\">(5)侧面：引发读者联想、想象、含蓄曲折地表现人物。</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
